We evaluate models of Llama3.1 series (Dubey et al., 2024), Qwen2 series (Yang et al., 2024a), and GPT4o.Llama3.1 and Qwen2.5 are the most

powerful small models,while GPT4o is the most powerful LLM. We list all models below.

· Llama3.1 8B, Llama3.1 70B;   
· Qwen2.5 1.5B, Qwen2.5 7B, Qwen2.5 72B;   
· GPT4o, GPT4o mini.
